<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" content="default-src 'none'; style-src 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'none'; form-action 'none'; base-uri 'none'">
<meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer">
<title>MCP configuration scan report</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #15171a;
    --panel: #1d2024;
    --panel-2: #23272c;
    --border: #2f343a;
    --text: #e3e5e8;
    --muted: #9aa1a9;
    --accent: #7f9cb8;
    --high: #d9786f;
    --medium: #d6ad62;
    --low: #8fa6bf;
    --ok: #8fb39a;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html { -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    font: 15px/1.55 system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  main { max-width: 1080px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px 16px 48px; }
  h1 { font-size: 1.55rem; margin: 0 0 4px; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
  h2 { font-size: 1.15rem; margin: 36px 0 12px; padding-bottom: 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
  h3 { font-size: 1rem; margin: 22px 0 10px; }
  p, li { color: var(--text); }
  .meta { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.88rem; margin: 0 0 16px; }
  .disclaimer {
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
    background: var(--panel);
    padding: 12px 14px;
    margin: 16px 0 8px;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }
  .stats { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(140px, 1fr)); gap: 10px; }
  .stat { background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 6px; padding: 12px 14px; }
  .stat .n { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 650; display: block; }
  .stat .l { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; }
  .table-wrap { overflow-x: auto; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 6px; }
  table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; font-size: 0.9rem; }
  th, td { text-align: left; vertical-align: top; padding: 8px 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
  th { background: var(--panel-2); color: var(--muted); font-weight: 600; white-space: nowrap; }
  tr:last-child td { border-bottom: 0; }
  td { overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .badge {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    padding: 2px 8px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    border: 1px solid currentColor;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .sev-high { color: var(--high); }
  .sev-medium { color: var(--medium); }
  .sev-low { color: var(--low); }
  .status-assessed { color: var(--ok); }
  .status-not { color: var(--medium); }
  .finding {
    background: var(--panel);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-left-width: 4px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 12px 14px;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
  }
  .finding.sev-high { border-left-color: var(--high); }
  .finding.sev-medium { border-left-color: var(--medium); }
  .finding.sev-low { border-left-color: var(--low); }
  .finding h4 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 0.98rem; color: var(--text); }
  .finding dl { display: grid; grid-template-columns: max-content 1fr; gap: 4px 12px; margin: 0; }
  .finding dt { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; }
  .finding dd { margin: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .finding ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 18px; }
  code, .mono { font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 0.86em; }
  code { background: var(--panel-2); padding: 1px 5px; border-radius: 4px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .muted { color: var(--muted); }
  footer { margin-top: 40px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.82rem; }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    body { font-size: 14px; }
    .finding dl { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .finding dt { margin-top: 6px; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
<header>
  <h1>MCP configuration scan report</h1>
  <p class="meta">Generated {{ report.generated_at }} by {{ report.tool.name }} {{ report.tool.version }} &middot; OWASP MCP Top 10 {{ report.catalog.owasp_version }}</p>
  <div class="disclaimer" role="note"><strong>Disclaimer.</strong> {{ report.disclaimer }}</div>
</header>

<section aria-labelledby="summary">
  <h2 id="summary">Summary</h2>
  <div class="stats">
    <div class="stat"><span class="n sev-high">{{ report.summary.by_severity.get("high", 0) }}</span><span class="l">High</span></div>
    <div class="stat"><span class="n sev-medium">{{ report.summary.by_severity.get("medium", 0) }}</span><span class="l">Medium</span></div>
    <div class="stat"><span class="n sev-low">{{ report.summary.by_severity.get("low", 0) }}</span><span class="l">Low</span></div>
    <div class="stat"><span class="n">{{ report.summary.total_findings }}</span><span class="l">Total findings</span></div>
    <div class="stat"><span class="n">{{ report.summary.total_servers }}</span><span class="l">Servers inventoried</span></div>
    <div class="stat"><span class="n">{{ inputs_ok }} / {{ report.inputs | length }}</span><span class="l">Config files read</span></div>
  </div>
  <h3>Inputs</h3>
  <div class="table-wrap">
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>Path</th><th>Client</th><th>Status</th><th>Servers</th><th>Error</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
    {% for item in report.inputs %}
      <tr><td class="mono">{{ item.path }}</td><td>{{ item.client }}</td><td>{{ item.status }}</td><td>{{ item.servers }}</td><td>{{ item.error or "" }}</td></tr>
    {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
  </div>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="coverage">
  <h2 id="coverage">Coverage matrix</h2>
  <p>Risks that cannot be assessed from configuration files are shown as not assessed. A lack of findings for those risks means nothing. {{ report.coverage_note }}{% if not_assessed %} Not assessed in this scan: {{ not_assessed | join(", ") }}.{% endif %}</p>
  <div class="table-wrap">
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>Risk</th><th>Title</th><th>Status</th><th>Checks</th><th>Findings</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
    {% for row in report.coverage %}
      <tr>
        <td>{{ row.risk_id }}</td>
        <td>{{ row.title }}</td>
        <td class="{{ 'status-assessed' if row.status == 'Assessed (static)' else 'status-not' }}">{{ row.status }}</td>
        <td>{{ row.check_ids | join(", ") or "-" }}</td>
        <td>{{ row.findings }}</td>
      </tr>
    {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
  </div>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="findings">
  <h2 id="findings">Findings</h2>
  {% if not groups %}
  <p>No findings for the risks that were assessed statically.</p>
  {% endif %}
  {% for group in groups %}
  <h3><span class="badge sev-{{ group.severity }}">{{ group.severity | upper }}</span> {{ group.findings | length }} finding{{ "" if group.findings | length == 1 else "s" }}</h3>
  {% for f in group.findings %}
  <article class="finding sev-{{ f.severity }}">
    <h4><span class="badge sev-{{ f.severity }}">{{ f.severity | upper }}</span> {{ f.check_id }}: {{ f.title }}</h4>
    <dl>
      <dt>Server</dt><dd><code>{{ f.server }}</code> ({{ f.client }})</dd>
      <dt>Source</dt><dd class="mono">{{ f.source_path }}</dd>
      <dt>Risks</dt><dd>{% for r in f.risk_ids %}{{ r }} ({{ titles.get(r, "") }}){{ "; " if not loop.last }}{% endfor %}</dd>
      <dt>Evidence</dt><dd class="mono">{{ f.evidence }}</dd>
      <dt>Relevant controls</dt>
      <dd>
        {% if f.controls %}
        <ul>
        {% for c in f.controls %}
          <li><strong>{{ framework_labels[c.framework] }} {{ c.control_id }}</strong> {{ c.title }} <span class="muted">({{ c.risk_id }}; {{ c.relationship }}, {{ c.confidence }} confidence)</span>{% if federal_note(c) %}<br><span class="muted">{{ federal_note(c) }}</span>{% endif %}</li>
        {% endfor %}
        </ul>
        <span class="muted">Indicators relevant to these controls, not a compliance determination.</span>
        {% else %}<span class="muted">None mapped.</span>{% endif %}
      </dd>
      <dt>Remediation</dt><dd>{{ f.remediation }}</dd>
      <dt>Finding ID</dt><dd class="mono">{{ f.id }}</dd>
    </dl>
  </article>
  {% endfor %}
  {% endfor %}
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="inventory">
  <h2 id="inventory">Server inventory</h2>
  <p>Every configured server, for manual review. Environment and header values are redacted unless they are variable references.</p>
  <div class="table-wrap">
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>Server</th><th>Client</th><th>Scope</th><th>Transport</th><th>Command or URL</th><th>Env keys</th><th>Source</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
    {% for s in report.servers %}
      <tr>
        <td><code>{{ s.name }}</code>{% if s.project %}<br><span class="muted mono">{{ s.project }}</span>{% endif %}</td>
        <td>{{ s.client }}</td>
        <td>{{ s.scope }}</td>
        <td>{{ s.transport }}</td>
        <td class="mono">{% if s.url %}{{ s.url }}{% else %}{{ s.command or "" }} {{ s.args | join(" ") }}{% endif %}</td>
        <td class="mono">{{ s.env.keys() | sort | join(", ") }}</td>
        <td class="mono">{{ s.source_path }}</td>
      </tr>
    {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
  </div>
</section>

<footer>
  <p>{{ report.disclaimer }}</p>
  <p>Risk IDs and titles: OWASP MCP Top 10 ({{ report.catalog.owasp_version }}), CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, referenced with attribution. Control text: NIST SP 800-53 Rev 5 and NIST CSF 2.0 (public domain).{% for fw in report.catalog.frameworks %} {{ fw.id }} catalog SHA-256 <span class="mono">{{ fw.source_sha256[:16] }}</span>&hellip;{% endfor %}</p>
</footer>
</main>
</body>
</html>
